// The hive (GDR-0026's boss sites, GDR-0027: "hives are the bosses"; GDR-0117): an anchored Swarm nest (a station,
// GDR-0110). A hub of three nerve nodes, and four pods round it, north, east, south and west, each joined to the hub
// by one bridge block, each with a nerve node of its own, a stinger and a brood hangar whose mouth faces outwards:
// twenty-four drones, the full hive flood. Shot off, a pod keeps its place, turns on its own node and floods on, like
// the Keeper's pods. PLACEHOLDER layout (lead default, 19 Oct 2026; docs/results/swarm-balance-2026-10-19.md).
